<ToolPrompt #WorkflowWorkspace.detail>
(
  <usage ?>Open a session first. For a ResourcePackage with selected_resource_refs, prefer one read_selection call: it returns the bounded exact depa-projected App/Workflow/Agent/Material source set from the candidate registry without scanning. Use tree only for directories; never read a mount root as a file. Use read for one exact file or bounded read_many for 1-12 exact files, then prefer one CAS batch patch for a coherent revision. The validate operation is legacy-only; after a ResourcePackage mutation call WorkflowPreparePublication directly as the single Halfcode/depa validation and proof authority. Every mutation invalidates prior proof.</?>
  <safety ?>Session paths are VFS paths under /base, /refs, /work or /out. /base and /refs are read-only. Never use shell or generic file tools to bypass this workspace.</?>
)>
